a Senado","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/49143546@N06\">Ag\u00eancia Senado</a> from Brasilia, Brazil","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"57494349":{"pageid":57494349,"ns":6,"title":"File:Congressos. Semin\u00e1rios. Palestras (32468406754).jpg","index":4,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2032265,"width":3696,"height":2448,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg/960px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":424,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg/1280px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg/960px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":424,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg/1280px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832468406754%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_(32468406754).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=57494349","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>A empres\u00e1ria Luiza Trajano, presidente do Conselho de Administra\u00e7\u00e3o do Magazine Luiza, ministra palestra no Senado Federal sobre empreendedorismo feminino, lideran\u00e7a e equidade. O encontro, aberto tamb\u00e9m ao p\u00fablico externo, faz parte das comemora\u00e7\u00f5es do Dia Internacional da Mulher como tema:  Mulheres - Igualdade no Trabalho.\n</p><p>Em pronunciamento, empres\u00e1ria Luiza Trajano.\n</p>\nFoto: Ana Volpe/Ag\u00eancia Senado","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/49143546@N06\">Senado Federal</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"57494351":{"pageid":57494351,"ns":6,"title":"File:Congressos. Semin\u00e1rios. Palestras (32928681270).jpg","index":5,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":1899182,"width":3696,"height":2448,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832928681270%29.jpg/960px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832928681270%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":424,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832928681270%29.jpg/1280px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832928681270%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832928681270%29.jpg/960px-Congressos._Semin%C3%A1rios._Palestras_%2832928681270%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imagei